---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="运营记录 - 光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main>
    <section class="philosophy" id="journal">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/guangyuying" class="btn-link" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; display: inline-flex;">← 返回光与影</a>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">运营记录</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">记录成长，复盘思考</p>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
          <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span style="background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); color: #4caf50; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">日记</span>
              <span>2026-08-24</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">对话录拆分完成，剑阁demo启动</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">完成三篇对话录的小红书/即刻风格拆分，剑阁Astro项目初始化。记录了从原始对话到多平台内容的拆分过程...</p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-24" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span style="background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); color: #4caf50; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">日记</span>
              <span>2026-08-23</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">剑阁域名确认，内容规划开始</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">确认lawseast.com作为剑阁主域名，开始规划网站内容结构和栏目设置...</p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-23" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;">
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span style="background: rgba(76,175,80,0.2); color: #4caf50; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: 0.7rem;">日记</span>
              <span>2026-08-22</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">项目启动，技术选型确定</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">确定使用Astro框架搭建剑阁，Tailwind CSS样式，部署到GitHub Pages...</p>
            <a href="/guangyuying/journal/2026-08-22" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>